# SPA fallback — serve the app shell for any path that doesn't match a
# static asset. Cloudflare Pages serves static assets (including the
# prerendered /conveyancing-solicitors-* pages) ahead of this catch-all.
#
# Do NOT add explicit per-path rules like "/about /index.html 200".
# On Cloudflare Pages those rules make the bare URL (no trailing slash)
# answer with "308 Permanent Redirect → /" instead of a 200 rewrite,
# which Google Search Console reports as "Page with redirect".
# Unmatched paths fall through to this catch-all and get a clean 200.
/* /index.html 200
